    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d144-a1">

                <pb facs="0299" n="187" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg187"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Reid to
                        the Minister for Foreign Affairs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-12-16"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 16,
                    1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that on the
                    1st of December last a protocol was concluded and signed at Santiago, Chile, by
                    the plenipotentiaries of the United <pb facs="0300" n="188" xml:id="pg188"/>
                    States of America and of Chile providing for the settlement of the Alsop claim,
                    the two Governments concerned having been unable to agree as to the amount
                    equitably due to the claimants.</p>
                <p>By Article II of this protocol, a copy of which is inclosed herewith, it is
                    agreed that the two Governments shall submit the whole controversy to His
                    Majesty the King for his friendly adjustment.</p>
                <p>In accordance with this agreement I am instructed to present the formal request
                    of my Government to His Majesty that he will be graciously pleased to consider
                    the case as presented under the protocol and determine what amount, if any, is
                    equitably due said claimants.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Whitelaw Reid.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
